@guide A_BurningSteppes
@name Burning Steppes (Morgan's Vigil)
@faction Alliance
@levels 53-56
@zone Burning Steppes
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Morgan's Vigil, the Firegut ogres, the Blackrock orcs and The True Masters chain. Blackrock Depths and Spire quests are optional group content.
@next A_WesternPlaguelands

accept Dragonkin Menace | Helendis Riverhorn.
complete Dragonkin Menace | Black Broodlings, Dragonkin Felbinders and dragonspawn.
turnin Dragonkin Menace
accept 4183 The True Masters
accept Extinguish the Firegut | Oralius.
complete Extinguish the Firegut | Firegut ogres at Dreadmaul Rock.
turnin Extinguish the Firegut
accept Gor'tesh the Brute Lord
complete Gor'tesh the Brute Lord [group=2] | Top of Dreadmaul Rock.
turnin Gor'tesh the Brute Lord
accept Ogre Head On A Stick = Party
complete Ogre Head On A Stick = Party | Click Soft Dirt Mound.
turnin Ogre Head On A Stick = Party
fp Morgan's Vigil
turnin 4183 The True Masters | Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire.
accept 4184 The True Masters
accept Broodling Essence | Tinkee Steamboil, Flame Crest.
complete Broodling Essence | Use the essence collector on broodlings.
turnin Broodling Essence
turnin Reassignment | Major Samuelson, also in Stormwind Keep.
turnin 4184 The True Masters | Highlord Bolvar Fordragon, Stormwind Keep.
turnin Warn Bolvar! [optional] | Bolvar again, while you are in the keep.
accept 4185 The True Masters | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
turnin 4185 The True Masters | Turned in at Stormwind City.
accept 4186 The True Masters
turnin 4186 The True Masters | Turned in at Redridge Mountains.
accept 4223 The True Masters
turnin 4223 The True Masters
accept 4224 The True Masters | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
complete 4224 The True Masters | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin 4224 The True Masters
level 55
train
note Fly to Ironforge (Courier Hammerfall has the Western Plaguelands call to arms), then to Chillwind Camp (via Aerie Peak or Southshore if you lack the path).
